{"id":"fc9994a38ae608cc","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-tm-recursive.md","title":"Turing Machine and Recursive Equivalence","display":"thm-tm-recursive — Turing Machine and Recursive Equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-tm-recursive","aliases":["88-thm-tm-recursive"],"display":"thm-tm-recursive — Turing Machine and Recursive Equivalence","depends_on":["[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-tm-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-tm-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tm-recursive — Turing Machine and Recursive Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\)</span> (mu-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\\)</span> (Turing-computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tm\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tm\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRec}\\)</span>均为同一部分函数上的谓词。</li>\n<li>Turing可计算与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>递归完全等价</li>\n<li>这是Church-Turing论题的数学基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)$ (mu-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-mu-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}(f)$ (Turing-computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tm\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Comp}(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":901,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-proof.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice.md]]\n[[88-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-sigma1-complete.md]]\n[[88-thm-smn.md]]\n[[88-thm-soundness.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-equals-recursive.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["bf4e721d88316525","64279ecae5246baf"]}